   "html": "<p>To amplify Disney’s World Premiere of their new film, they enlisted IHC to provide two interactive photo moments and high-flying basketball programming. We also supported with additional influencer guest outreach, resulting in a slam dunk of an evening! </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "the hoop bus",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>We brought in the beloved Hoop Bus, hosted by National Champion Dunkers, including Elvin Rodriguez and Brandon “BodyBag” Moss. Guests were able to engage in quick games and rounds of shootouts, providing immersive entertainment ahead of the screening.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
