  },
  {
   "title": "Photo moments",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Two separate photo opps allowed fans to insert themselves in the middle of the hoop action. The first, executed with a ramp and a green screen, made it appear as if they were in-air, mid-dunk. The other provided a branded backboard and net for them to hang off of. Each provided a dynamic digital takeaway for all participants.   </p>\n<p>‍</p>"
